 pending \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003e I loved the first two books and I finally got my libby I can't wait for her story!!! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003ewhat I love most about these stories is that they are FEEL relatively short, and this one is 600+ pages PFFFF let's see how fast I read this one \u003c/i\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3K19JM0X1S65M\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.yay0xO3eC2-yQGoT\"}}"},"likeCount":67,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":35},"User:76194326":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":76194326,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1593729638i/76194326._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":4050,"textReviewsCount":726,"name":"✩ Yaz ✩","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/76194326-yaz","contributor":null,"id":76194326},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1XZ5IMX40AG8U":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1XZ5IMX40AG8U"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1XZ5IMX40AG8U\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.WB1aDi44dlXFDh0O\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1XZ5IMX40AG8U","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1XZ5IMX40AG8U"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.WB1aDi44dlXFDh0O","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.WB1aDi44dlXFDh0O"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/76194326?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"2022-releases","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/76194326?shelf=2022-releases"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"adult-na","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/76194326?shelf=adult-na"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"enemies-to-lovers","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/76194326?shelf=enemies-to-lovers"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fantasy","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/76194326?shelf=fantasy"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/76194326?shelf=romance"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4147953609"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.9tVmwAa6rFNFZYbsmYu79w":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.9tVmwAa6rFNFZYbsmYu79w","creator":{"__ref":"User:76194326"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1776490937432,"createdAt":1654096951475,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1654142535806,"text":"3.5 - ⭐️⭐️⭐️💫\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e“God help me, Valcotta, you undo me like none other.” \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e“Because you are mine. And no one else’s.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe Inadequate Heir\u003c/b\u003e is the third book of the Bridge Kingdom series but it debuts new protagonists and the events of this book occur on parallel to \u003cb\u003eThe Traitor Queen\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIt features a forbidden romance between two sworn enemies, both heirs honed to be weapons at cruel hands but are led by different ideals. Keris is bookish and hopes for peace and Zarrah is her aunt's lethal general led by a desire for vengeance for the death of her mother.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e“I’d fallen for you before I knew your name. You are everything I can never be. You are powerful and strong and brave. You make me believe I can be better. You give me hope. You are my hope.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eZarrah and Keris fell for each other knowing well that their love is their damnation. If someone caught an whiff of their affair, they've would've died a painful death.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI liked Zarrah and Keris but I didn't get attached to them as I did with Lara and Aren. Maybe it's because this book was loaded with politics more so than the duology. I love political intrigue and court drama but too much of it can put a strain on the story.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere were moments that made me hold my breath because any slip from Zarrah and Keris would've had severe consequences.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI think my main issue with the book is the events because they all happen in parallel with The Traitor Queen, so it felt to me I was rereading the events of TTQ through different POVs. It didn't serve the plot of this book well even though I mostly enjoyed Zarrah and Keris's time at the Harem.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI have high hopes for the next book since the events that will unfold will be new and the plot will benefit from it.","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1XZ5IMX40AG8U\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.WB1aDi44dlXFDh0O\"}}"},"likeCount":65,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":4},"User:136844705":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":136844705,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1742746453i/136844705._UY200_CR4,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1224,"textReviewsCount":787,"name":"monica ✨ romantasyreader","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/136844705-monica-romantasyreader","contributor":null,"id":136844705},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2PGTI91PDBWHK":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2PGTI91PDBWHK"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2PGTI91PDBWHK\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.WB1aDi44d